### Staj API — Uçtan Uca Smoke Test
### Visual Studio HTTP Client ile çalıştırın. İstekleri yukarıdan aşağı SIRAYLA gönderin;
### her istek bir öncekinin response'undan token/ID okuyor. Bir istek fail olursa
### akış kırılır — orada durup sebebe bakın.
###
### Rastgele Guid'ler için "Send Request" öncesi VS otomatik $guid tag'ını çözer.
### Kayıt sırasında her çalıştırmada aynı email'i kullanmamak için timestamp ekliyoruz.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5041
@adminEmail = admin@staj.local
@adminPassword = Admin123!

### Test kullanıcıları için sabit email'ler.
### İkinci kez smoke'u çalıştıracaksan bu iki değeri manuel değiştir
### (ör. freelancer2@staj.test) çünkü aynı email tekrar register olamaz.
@freelancerEmail = freelancer1@staj.test
@freelancerPassword = Freelance123!
@clientEmail = client1@staj.test
@clientPassword = Client123!


###############################################################################
### 1. ADMIN LOGIN
###############################################################################

# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

###
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Teşhis: adminToken gerçekten çözülüyor mu? Bu istek 200 dönerse chain çalışıyor demek.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


###############################################################################
### 2. MASTER DATA — Kategori ve skill listesi geliyor mu?
###############################################################################

### 10 kategori dönmeli (seed'den)
# @name listCategories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

###
### Web Geliştirme kategorisinin ID'sini yakala (list sıralamasına göre değişebilir,
### aşağıdaki sabit "0" indeksi sadece "bir tane geldi" doğrulaması içindir).
### Aşağıda ID'yi kullanmak için ismiyle arama yapmıyoruz; response'taki ilk
### aktif kategorinin ID'sini kullanıyoruz.
@firstCategoryId = {{listCategories.response.body.$.data[0].id}}

### 47 skill dönmeli
# @name listSkills
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skills

###
### İlk 3 skill'in ID'sini yakala (JobPost ve Freelancer skill setleri için)
@skill1Id = {{listSkills.response.body.$.data[0].id}}
@skill2Id = {{listSkills.response.body.$.data[1].id}}
@skill3Id = {{listSkills.response.body.$.data[2].id}}


###############################################################################
### 3. KULLANICI KAYITLARI
###############################################################################

### Freelancer kaydı
# @name registerFreelancer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{freelancerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{freelancerPassword}}",
  "firstName": "Furkan",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "role": "Freelancer"
}

###

### Client kaydı
# @name registerClient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{clientEmail}}",
  "password": "{{clientPassword}}",
  "firstName": "Ahmet",
  "lastName": "Musteri",
  "role": "Client"
}


###############################################################################
### 4. LOGIN — Token alalım
###############################################################################

# @name loginFreelancer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{freelancerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{freelancerPassword}}"
}

###
@freelancerToken = {{loginFreelancer.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@freelancerUserId = {{loginFreelancer.response.body.$.data.userId}}

###

# @name loginClient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{clientEmail}}",
  "password": "{{clientPassword}}"
}

###
@clientToken = {{loginClient.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@clientUserId = {{loginClient.response.body.$.data.userId}}


###############################################################################
### 5. /me endpoint'leri — Token doğru çalışıyor mu?
###############################################################################

# @name meFreelancer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}

###

# @name meClient
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}


###############################################################################
### 6. FREELANCER PROFİL AKIŞI
###############################################################################

### Ad-soyad güncelle
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/basic-info
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Furkan",
  "lastName": "Yılmaz"
}

###

### Freelancer profil upsert
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/freelancers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior .NET Developer",
  "bio": "10+ yıl .NET tecrübem var. Clean Architecture ve DDD üzerine çalışıyorum.",
  "experienceYears": 10,
  "hourlyRateMin": 30,
  "hourlyRateMax": 60,
  "currency": "USD",
  "country": "Türkiye",
  "city": "İstanbul",
  "cvUrl": "https://example.com/cv.pdf",
  "linkedInUrl": "https://linkedin.com/in/furkantest",
  "gitHubUrl": "https://github.com/furkantest",
  "websiteUrl": "https://furkan.dev",
  "isAvailable": true
}

###

### Skill ata — seed'deki ilk 3 skill
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/freelancers/me/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skills": [
    { "skillId": "{{skill1Id}}", "proficiencyLevel": 5 },
    { "skillId": "{{skill2Id}}", "proficiencyLevel": 4 },
    { "skillId": "{{skill3Id}}", "proficiencyLevel": 3 }
  ]
}

###

### Portfolio kalemi ekle
# @name addPortfolio
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/freelancers/me/portfolio
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "E-Ticaret Platformu",
  "description": ".NET 10 tabanlı, mikroservis mimarisi ile geliştirilmiş e-ticaret altyapısı.",
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/furkan/eticaret",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/img/eticaret.png",
  "displayOrder": 1
}

###
@portfolioItemId = {{addPortfolio.response.body.$.data}}

###

### Kendi profilimi getir — bio, skill'ler, portfolio, rating dolu gelmeli
# @name myFreelancerProfile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/freelancers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}

###
@freelancerProfileId = {{myFreelancerProfile.response.body.$.data.id}}


###############################################################################
### 7. CLIENT PROFİL AKIŞI
###############################################################################

### Client profil upsert (ContactPreference enum: Email=1, Phone=2, PlatformMessage=3)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/me
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Test Yazılım A.Ş.",
  "industry": "Bilişim",
  "about": "Yenilikçi yazılım projelerinde uzman ekiplerle çalışıyoruz.",
  "websiteUrl": "https://testyazilim.example",
  "country": "Türkiye",
  "city": "Ankara",
  "contactPreference": 3,
  "contactPhone": "+905550001122"
}

###

### Client profilimi getir
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clients/me
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}


###############################################################################
### 8. FREELANCER ARAMA — public endpoint
###############################################################################

### Herhangi bir token olmadan da çalışmalı, freelancer'ımız listede olmalı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/freelancers?page=1&pageSize=10

###

### Freelancer detay — public (rating summary + son yorumlar boş)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/freelancers/{{freelancerProfileId}}


###############################################################################
### 9. JOB POST AKIŞI — Client oluşturuyor
###############################################################################

### İlan oluştur (WorkMode enum: Remote=1, Hybrid=2, OnSite=3)
# @name createJob
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "{{firstCategoryId}}",
  "title": "Senior .NET Developer aranıyor",
  "description": "Clean Architecture ile mikroservis projesi için tecrübeli .NET geliştirici arıyoruz.",
  "budgetMin": 40,
  "budgetMax": 80,
  "currency": "USD",
  "workMode": 1,
  "durationDays": 60,
  "country": "Türkiye",
  "city": "İstanbul",
  "skillIds": [ "{{skill1Id}}", "{{skill2Id}}" ]
}

###
@jobPostId = {{createJob.response.body.$.data}}

###

### İlanı yayına al
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobPostId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

###

### İlan detay — public
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobPostId}}

###

### İlan araması — Freelancer bunu görebilmeli
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs?page=1&pageSize=10


###############################################################################
### 10. PROPOSAL AKIŞI — Application (Freelancer başvurur)
###############################################################################

### Freelancer ilana başvuru gönderir
# @name submitApp
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/proposals/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobPostId": "{{jobPostId}}",
  "coverMessage": "Merhaba, bu proje için biçilmiş kaftanım. .NET ve mikroservis konusunda 10 yıl tecrübem var.",
  "proposedRate": 50,
  "proposedDurationDays": 45,
  "currency": "USD"
}

###
@applicationId = {{submitApp.response.body.$.data}}

###

### Client'ın kendi ilanına gelen başvuruları görmesi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/proposals/for-job/{{jobPostId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

###

### Freelancer'ın kendi gönderdiği proposal listesi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/proposals/me
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}

###

### Client başvuruyu Accept ediyor — Freelancer'a bildirim düşmeli
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/proposals/{{applicationId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}


###############################################################################
### 11. NOTIFICATION KONTROLÜ — Accept sonrası Freelancer'a bildirim
###############################################################################

### Okunmamış sayacı en az 1 olmalı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/me/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}

###

### Bildirim listesi
# @name freelancerNotifs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/me?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}


###############################################################################
### 12. DIRECT OFFER — Client → Freelancer'a doğrudan teklif
###############################################################################

# @name submitOffer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/proposals/direct-offers
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "freelancerProfileId": "{{freelancerProfileId}}",
  "coverMessage": "Küçük bir danışmanlık projesi var, ilgilenir misin?",
  "proposedRate": 70,
  "proposedDurationDays": 15,
  "currency": "USD"
}

###
@directOfferId = {{submitOffer.response.body.$.data}}

###

### Freelancer teklife bakar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/proposals/{{directOfferId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}

###

### Freelancer teklifi Accept eder — Client'a bildirim düşmeli
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/proposals/{{directOfferId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}

###

### Client tarafında bildirim
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/me/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}


###############################################################################
### 13. MESSAGING — Client Freelancer'a mesaj atsın
###############################################################################

### Conversation başlat (idempotent — aynı çift için tek conversation)
# @name startConv
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "otherUserId": "{{freelancerUserId}}"
}

###
@conversationId = {{startConv.response.body.$.data}}

###

### Mesaj gönder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
  "content": "Merhaba, projeye ne zaman başlayabiliriz?"
}

###

### Freelancer conversation listesi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}

###

### Freelancer mesajlarını görsün
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}

###

### Freelancer okunmamış sayacı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}

###

### Freelancer cevap versin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
  "content": "Merhaba, önümüzdeki hafta başlayabilirim."
}

###

### Client okundu işaretlesin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}


###############################################################################
### 14. REVIEW — Accepted Application üzerinden karşılıklı değerlendirme
###############################################################################

### Client → Freelancer'a değerlendirme
# @name reviewByClient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proposalId": "{{applicationId}}",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Freelancer profesyonel, hızlı ve kaliteli iş çıkardı. Kesinlikle tekrar çalışırız."
}

###

### Freelancer → Client'a değerlendirme
# @name reviewByFreelancer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proposalId": "{{applicationId}}",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "İşveren gereksinimleri net iletti, ödeme sürecinde iletişim çok iyiydi."
}

###

### Freelancer'a yazılmış review'lar — public
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/for-user/{{freelancerUserId}}?page=1&pageSize=10

###

### Freelancer'ın rating summary'si (ortalama + toplam) — public
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/for-user/{{freelancerUserId}}/summary

###

### Freelancer detayında rating görünmeli (Module 8 entegrasyonu)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/freelancers/{{freelancerProfileId}}


###############################################################################
### 15. NOTIFICATION — Nihai kontrol ve mark-as-read
###############################################################################

### Freelancer'ın bildirim listesi (kabul, mesaj, review vb.)
# @name finalNotifs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/me?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}

###
@firstNotifId = {{finalNotifs.response.body.$.data.items[0].id}}

###

### Bir bildirimi okundu yap
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/{{firstNotifId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}

###

### Kalan tümünü okundu yap
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/me/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}

###

### Unread-count artık 0 olmalı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/me/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}


###############################################################################
### 16. YETKİ TESTLERİ — Negatif senaryolar
###############################################################################

### Token'sız /me → 401 dönmeli
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me

###

### Freelancer, Client'ın endpoint'ini çağırırsa → 403 veya iş kuralı hatası
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "{{firstCategoryId}}",
  "title": "Yetkisiz ilan denemesi",
  "description": "Bu isteğin fail olması bekleniyor.",
  "budgetMin": 10,
  "budgetMax": 20,
  "currency": "USD",
  "workMode": 1,
  "durationDays": 30,
  "country": "TR",
  "city": "İstanbul",
  "skillIds": []
}

###

### Aynı ilana ikinci başvuru → duplicate hatası bekleniyor (business rule)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/proposals/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{freelancerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobPostId": "{{jobPostId}}",
  "coverMessage": "Bu başvuru duplicate — Result.Fail dönmeli.",
  "proposedRate": 50,
  "proposedDurationDays": 45,
  "currency": "USD"
}


###############################################################################
### 17. REFRESH TOKEN — Access token yenileme
###############################################################################

### Not: Refresh, access token expire olduğunda kullanılır. Burada
### sadece endpoint'in çalıştığını doğruluyoruz — response'u check et.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessToken": "{{freelancerToken}}",
  "refreshToken": "{{loginFreelancer.response.body.$.data.refreshToken}}"
}


###############################################################################
### AKIŞ SONU
###############################################################################
### Buraya kadar geldiyse şu doğrulandı:
### - Auth (register/login/refresh)
### - Master data (kategori/skill seed)
### - Profil upsert (Freelancer/Client)
### - JobPost CRUD + publish
### - Proposal Application ve DirectOffer akışı + Accept
### - Messaging (conversation + mesaj + read)
### - Review (karşılıklı + rating aggregation)
### - Notification (unread-count, list, mark-as-read, read-all)
### - Yetki filtreleri (401/403)
### - Duplicate iş kuralı
###
### SignalR real-time push'ları için signalr-test.html sayfasını kullan.
